### ===================================================================
### GoBench Distributed Task Scheduling Platform - API Test Suite
### (Designed for VS Code "REST Client" Extension)
### ===================================================================
### Quick Start:
### 1. Run the server: `go run ./cmd/server/main.go`
### 2. Send request "2. 用户注册" to register a user.
### 3. Send request "3. 用户登录" to login and dynamically set the {{token}} variable.
### 4. Run any of the authorized endpoints below!
### ===================================================================

### 1. 系统健康检查 (无需权限)
GET http://localhost:8080/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. 用户注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "gnk48lb",
    "password": "8964"
}

###

### 3. 用户登录 (登录成功后会自动将 Token 注入 {{token}} 变量，无需手动复制)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "gnk48lb",
    "password": "8964"
}

###

### ===================================================================
### 变量声明 (由登录接口返回值动态填充，若未填充可在此手动修改)
### ===================================================================
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}


### ===================================================================
### 任务管理模块 (CRUD) - 需 JWT 鉴权与限流控制 (10 req/min)
### ===================================================================

### 4. 创建任务 1 (正常 Function 计算类型)
# @name createTask1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "抖音用户收益计算",
    "task_type": "function",
    "cron_expr": "0 0 * * *",
    "payload": "{\"batch_size\": 1000, \"simulate_count\": 1000000}",
    "retry_count": 3,
    "timeout": 120
}

###

### 5. 创建任务 2 (Shell 脚本类型)
# @name createTask2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "清理过期视频缓存",
    "task_type": "shell",
    "cron_expr": "0 2 * * *",
    "payload": "{\"command\": \"echo 'Cleaning expired video cache...'\"}",
    "retry_count": 1,
    "timeout": 60
}

###

### 6. 获取任务列表 (带分页测试)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 7. 获取单个任务详情
### (默认读取刚创建的任务 1 的 ID, 也可以修改末尾的数字如 /1)
@taskId1 = {{createTask1.response.body.data.ID}}
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. 更新任务属性及状态 (将状态更新为 paused 暂停)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "抖音用户收益计算-已暂停",
    "task_type": "function",
    "cron_expr": "0 0 * * *",
    "payload": "{\"batch_size\": 1000}",
    "retry_count": 5,
    "timeout": 120,
    "status": "paused"
}

###

### 9. 删除任务 (如需测试，可对任务 2 执行逻辑删除)
@taskId2 = {{createTask2.response.body.data.ID}}
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ===================================================================
### 高并发引擎、分布式队列与任务流转测试接口
### ===================================================================

### 10. 手动立即触发任务执行 (推入 Redis 队列并由 Worker 消费)
### (默认触发刚才创建的任务 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1/trigger
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. 获取该任务的执行历史日志列表 (带分页)
### (可以观察状态从 pending -> running -> success 变化，以及对应的 WorkerID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1/logs?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ===================================================================
### 大规模计算模拟与分布式锁测试
### ===================================================================

### 12. 创建大规模百万用户收益计算任务
# @name createHeavyTask
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "硬核百万收益计算器",
    "task_type": "function",
    "cron_expr": "",
    "payload": "{\"batch_size\": 1000, \"simulate_count\": 1000000}",
    "retry_count": 3,
    "timeout": 120
}

###

### 13. 手动触发硬核百万计算任务 (验证 Worker 并发池与任务耗时模拟)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/3/trigger
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 14. 查看该硬核任务的运行输出日志及执行进度
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/3/logs?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ===================================================================
### 延迟队列与高可用分布式调度测试 (Phase 2 - Step 2.3 新增)
### ===================================================================

### 15. 延迟调度任务 (指定秒数后自动进入 Worker 消费队列)
### (默认将在 10 秒后触发，可修改 delay_seconds 进行自定义)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "delay_seconds": 10
}

###

### 16. 获取刚才延迟调度任务的执行历史
### (延迟期间可以在此观察状态为 pending，15秒后状态变为 running -> success)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1/logs?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ===================================================================
### 滑动窗口限流控制测试 (Rate Limiting)
### ===================================================================
### 提示: 我们的 RateLimitMiddleware 设置为了 10次/分钟。
### 你可以快速、连续点击发送上述任意带有 /tasks 的请求 (例如 "6. 获取任务列表")。
### 超过 10 次后，服务器将返回 HTTP 429 Too Many Requests 错误，包含 JSON:
### { "code": 429, "msg": "too many requests" }
### ===================================================================